<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>LivePole Server</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2c3e50;
            --secondary: #3498db;
            --success: #27ae60;
            --bg: #f8f9fa;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #e8f5e9;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .status-badge span {
            color: var(--success);
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .status-status{
            color: var(--success);
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon">🗄️</div>
        <h1>Server API - Server Status Page</h1>
        
        <div class="status-badge">
            <span>●</span> SERVICE STATUS: <span class="status-status"> All Systems Operational</span>
        </div>

        <p>
            Welcome to the Live Pole! This is an status page for our backend service. 
            If you're looking for the user interface, please visit the main app below.
        </p>

        <a href="https://frontend.example.com" class="btn">Visit Frontend App</a>

        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/docs">API Documentation</a>
            <a href="/health">Health Check</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>